'''Green Fire''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.   

== Appearance ==
Its blade is green that fades into a lighter shade with a fire texture imprinted over it, hence the name. The guard is green, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* It has a red variant under the name [[Red Fire]], making the Fire Set.

